{% comment %}
  ============================================================================
  task 0004 (Task 1) — About Page, Section 1: "Our Story + Our Mission"
  ============================================================================
  DXB confirmed the 4-section grouping in 0004_task1_intent.md: the page-header intro
  ("ABOUT US" eyebrow, "Our Story" heading, intro paragraph) is grouped with the Mission
  block (photo + 3 paragraphs) directly below it into one combined section, since they're
  visually adjacent and both establish who Flora Bella is. Content from AboutPage.tsx in the
  Hydrogen reference (buyflorabella_restore/dev/frontend/app/componentsMockup2/pages/).

  NO BLOCKS: unlike most of this task series, this section has zero repeatable content — one
  eyebrow, one heading, one intro paragraph, one mission heading, a fixed set of mission
  paragraphs, one mission photo. Per this project's rule that blocks are for repeatable
  editorial content ("a list of things with text fields"), a single-instance section like this
  is plain section settings, not a block — nothing here needs the theme-blocks architecture.

  MISSION PARAGRAPHS: production has exactly 3 mission paragraphs. Originally built as one
  plain textarea (one line = one paragraph, matching blocks/bfbella-step.liquid's bullet-list
  convention) — 2026-09-07 UPDATE: DXB asked for bold/italic support here, useful beyond this
  field too (flagged for the Learn page as well). Switched to Shopify's native `richtext` field
  type instead of inventing custom markdown-style parsing — it's the theme-native way to get a
  real WYSIWYG toolbar (bold/italic/links, and its own paragraph breaks) with zero custom
  parsing logic, and the field's own HTML output is rendered directly rather than split on
  newlines. The existing 3-paragraph content was converted from plain-text-with-newlines to
  real `<p>` tags to keep working under the new field type.

  CONTENT: zero real copy hardcoded — every field is a blank native setting until DXB fills
  it in. See 0004_task1_howto.md for the exact production text (including a note on the
  source file's stray markdown-style "**SOIL**" that should be treated as plain text unless
  DXB wants it styled as emphasis) and the flagged question of whether this mission copy is
  still current for the site's present soil/gardening positioning.

  MEDIA: the Mission photo has no source in this build at all — production's Hydrogen file
  references a local path (`/20260105_163329.jpg`), not a Shopify CDN URL, so there's nothing
  to point a fallback at. DXB needs to upload this photo (or a substitute) to Shopify Files
  directly; the image_picker field below is blank until then.

  COLOR: no hardcoded hex. Accent resolves through `section.settings.accent_color`, falling
  back to the theme's own `color_palette.color3`. Background resolves through
  `section.settings.background_color`, falling back to `settings.color_palette.background`
  (the theme's base light color) — this is a page-intro section, styled light like
  bfbella-community.liquid rather than dark like most homepage sections in this task series.

  THIS SECTION RENDERS ITS OWN <h1> (see below) — same as Shopify's native "main-page" section's
  title block does via `{{ closest.page.title }}`. Once both are live on the same page, that's
  two H1s on one page (an SEO/accessibility issue, not just visual redundancy). See this
  session's live-edit pilot notes for the recommendation on disabling the native title block's
  visibility once this section goes live.

  DEPLOY: written directly into this live repo's working tree as part of the 2026-09-07
  live-edit pilot (see claude_docs/build_docs/live_edit_pilot_plan.md) — a deliberate exception
  to this project's normal task-folder-only rule, for this trial only. Claude still did not
  commit or push this — DXB reviews, then commits and pushes by hand.
  ============================================================================
{% endcomment %}

{% liquid
  assign accent = section.settings.accent_color | default: settings.color_palette.color3
  assign bg = section.settings.background_color | default: settings.color_palette.background

  if section.settings.background_color != blank
    render 'contrast-override', background_color: section.settings.background_color, section_id: section.id, skip_contrast: true
  endif
%}

<div
  id="AboutStory-{{ section.id }}"
  class="bfbella-about-story{% if section.settings.background_color != blank %} color-custom-{{ section.id }}{% endif %}"
  style="
    --bfbella-accent: {{ accent }};
    --bfbella-bg: {{ bg }};
    {% if section.settings.padding_top != blank %}--bfbella-pad-top: {{ section.settings.padding_top }}px;{% endif %}
    {% if section.settings.padding_bottom != blank %}--bfbella-pad-bottom: {{ section.settings.padding_bottom }}px;{% endif %}
  "
>
  <div class="bfbella-about-story__inner page-width">

    {%- if section.settings.eyebrow != blank or section.settings.heading != blank or section.settings.intro != blank -%}
      <div class="bfbella-about-story__intro">
        {%- if section.settings.eyebrow != blank -%}
          <span class="bfbella-about-story__eyebrow">{{ section.settings.eyebrow }}</span>
        {%- endif -%}
        {%- if section.settings.heading != blank -%}
          <h1 class="bfbella-about-story__heading">{{ section.settings.heading }}</h1>
        {%- endif -%}
        {%- if section.settings.intro != blank -%}
          <p class="bfbella-about-story__intro-text">{{ section.settings.intro }}</p>
        {%- endif -%}
      </div>
    {%- endif -%}

    {%- if section.settings.mission_heading != blank or section.settings.mission_paragraphs != blank or section.settings.mission_image != blank -%}
      <div class="bfbella-about-story__mission">
        <div class="bfbella-about-story__mission-media">
          <div class="bfbella-about-story__mission-frame">
            {%- if section.settings.mission_image != blank -%}
              {{
                section.settings.mission_image
                | image_url: width: 1200
                | image_tag: loading: 'lazy', alt: section.settings.mission_heading, class: 'bfbella-about-story__mission-img'
              }}
            {%- endif -%}
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="bfbella-about-story__mission-content">
          {%- if section.settings.mission_heading != blank -%}
            <h2 class="bfbella-about-story__mission-heading">{{ section.settings.mission_heading }}</h2>
          {%- endif -%}
          {%- if section.settings.mission_paragraphs != blank -%}
            <div class="bfbella-about-story__mission-paragraphs">{{ section.settings.mission_paragraphs }}</div>
          {%- endif -%}
        </div>
      </div>
    {%- endif -%}

  </div>
</div>

{% stylesheet %}
  .bfbella-about-story {
    position: relative;
    padding-block-start: var(--bfbella-pad-top, 6rem);
    padding-block-end: var(--bfbella-pad-bottom, 5rem);
    background-color: var(--bfbella-bg);
    color: var(--color-foreground);
  }

  .bfbella-about-story__inner {
    max-width: 80rem;
    margin-inline: auto;
    padding-inline: 1.5rem;
  }

  .bfbella-about-story__intro {
    text-align: center;
    max-width: 44rem;
    margin-inline: auto;
    margin-block-end: 5rem;
  }

  .bfbella-about-story__eyebrow {
    display: inline-block;
    font-size: 0.8rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    letter-spacing: 0.08em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    color: var(--bfbella-accent);
    background: color-mix(in srgb, var(--bfbella-accent) 10%, transparent);
    border: 1px solid color-mix(in srgb, var(--bfbella-accent) 30%, transparent);
    border-radius: 999px;
    padding: 0.5rem 1rem;
    margin-block-end: 1.5rem;
  }

  .bfbella-about-story__heading {
    font-size: clamp(2.5rem, 6vw, 3.75rem);
    font-weight: 700;
    line-height: 1.1;
    margin-block-end: 1.25rem;
  }

  .bfbella-about-story__intro-text {
    font-size: 1.2rem;
    opacity: 0.75;
    line-height: 1.6;
  }

  .bfbella-about-story__mission {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1fr;
    gap: 2.5rem;
    align-items: center;

    @media screen and (min-width: 990px) {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
      gap: 4rem;
    }
  }

  .bfbella-about-story__mission-media {
    position: relative;
  }

  .bfbella-about-story__mission-frame {
    position: relative;
    aspect-ratio: 4 / 3;
    border-radius: 1rem;
    overflow: hidden;
    border: 1px solid rgb(var(--color-foreground-rgb) / 0.1);
    box-shadow: 0 25px 50px -12px rgb(0 0 0 / 0.15);
    background-color: rgb(var(--color-foreground-rgb) / 0.05);
  }

  .bfbella-about-story__mission-img {
    width: 100%;
    height: 100%;
    object-fit: cover;
    transition: transform 0.7s;
  }

  .bfbella-about-story__mission-media:hover .bfbella-about-story__mission-img {
    transform: scale(1.1);
  }

  @media (prefers-reduced-motion: reduce) {
    .bfbella-about-story__mission-img {
      transition: none;
    }
  }

  .bfbella-about-story__mission-heading {
    font-size: 1.9rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    line-height: 1.15;
    margin-block-end: 1.25rem;
  }

  .bfbella-about-story__mission-paragraphs p {
    font-size: 1.05rem;
    line-height: 1.65;
    opacity: 0.78;
    margin: 0 0 1.1rem;
  }

  .bfbella-about-story__mission-paragraphs p:last-child {
    margin-block-end: 0;
  }

  .bfbella-about-story__mission-paragraphs strong {
    font-weight: 700;
    opacity: 1;
  }

  .bfbella-about-story__mission-paragraphs em {
    font-style: italic;
  }
{% endstylesheet %}

{% schema %}
{
  "name": "BFBella — About Story",
  "tag": "section",
  "class": "section-wrapper",
  "settings": [
    {
      "type": "header",
      "content": "Page-header intro"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "id": "eyebrow",
      "label": "Eyebrow badge"
